registration_vectors.json is a verbatim copy of Reticulum-post
php/tests/vectors/registration_vectors.json as of main d27c476 (format 6;
the file itself last changed in 5ae640f). Retichat-js carries the same bytes
as registration_vectors.json; both suites test REGISTRATION-STAGE1.md
against it. It is generated by Reticulum-post tools/registration_vectors.py.

SHA-256 7d2bcfee1742a6421a05e2b212c04182cc94247d53128ad91d35139fb07304ef

Never edit it by hand. To update it, copy the file again from Reticulum-post
and change FIXTURE_SHA256 in src/interfaces/post_registration.rs, whose test
`the_fixture_is_the_shared_stage1_copy` fails on any other bytes.
